  "description": "\"Say, what do you want?\"  \n\"You, I want you. That means that it will be Cha Hee-joo or Jin-han's.\"  \n“……What does it mean to be yours?\"  \n\"Literally. Everything I want.\"\n\nHeavenly and heavenly, child-only existence,  \nSo noble and noble young master, Jinhan.  \nTo him, who has nothing to be desired or lacking in the world  \nThere is only one 'his' that I want to have.  \nBecause of the poor and low blood flow  \nCha Hee-joo, the daughter of a car driver who recognized her as a bug.  \nI wanted her so badly.  \nI wanted to make her his whole life.  \nSo he ordered her,  \nBe his exclusive maid!\n\nCha Hee-joo, a dedicated maid of the proud young master.  \nThe young master's secret kiss to her begins!\n\n* It's a pure cartoon based on the popular romance novel [The Young Master's Secret Kiss]. (MTL)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6039538)  \nR19: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/SecretKiss/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/private_kiss)",
